        "username": "Karmikl",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/karmikl/{size}/508632_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-08-22T22:30:41.528Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello fellow capsuleers,</p>\n<p>I’ve built <strong>Slipway</strong>, a free industry planner. No sign-in needed to use it, no<br>\nsubscription, ever.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://slipway.karmikl.space\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://slipway.karmikl.space/logo.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://slipway.karmikl.space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Slipway</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/361;\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/a/1/c/a1cf6230a6fc85e368568d49747b78c462d09f10_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"0E1820\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://slipway.karmikl.space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Slipway — EVE Online industry planner</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Find what to build, check the market can absorb it, and price it across every hub — including structure markets no public browser can see. Now with hauling routes.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>It answers one question: <strong>what should I build, where should I build it, and where<br>\nshould I sell it?</strong> Pick a hub, get every T1 and T2 line ranked by what it actually<br>\nearns — not just the headline ISK/hour, but after the job fee in a real system, the<br>\nmaterials where <em>you</em> buy them, and the sale where <em>you</em> sell them.</p>\n<p><strong>What it does</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Ranks every manufacturing line, invention line and reaction formula in the game<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Buy hub, build system and sell region are three separate choices — because the<br>\nright hub to build in is often not the one with the best sell price<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Caps every line by real traded volume, so it won’t tell you a thing that sells 3 a<br>\nweek earns 5b/hour<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Models your engineering complex: each rig applies to what CCP says it applies to,<br>\nscaled by the security of your system<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Plan</strong> — give it capital, slots and a horizon, get a build queue and a shopping list<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Trade</strong> — what’s worth hauling between two markets, ranked by profit per m³, and<br>\nit’ll fill a hold for you<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Market browser across every tracked region and structure</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/f/7/6/f76d0108f242b6313b1f394c242b7a6fb27f7634.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/ziPtsZPzm0kf4h9JBl2a8GfslJG.png?dl=1\" title=\"manufacture\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/f/7/6/f76d0108f242b6313b1f394c242b7a6fb27f7634_2_494x499.png\" alt=\"manufacture\" data-base62-sha1=\"ziPtsZPzm0kf4h9JBl2a8GfslJG\" width=\"494\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/f/7/6/f76d0108f242b6313b1f394c242b7a6fb27f7634_2_494x499.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/f/7/6/f76d0108f242b6313b1f394c242b7a6fb27f7634_2_741x748.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/f/7/6/f76d0108f242b6313b1f394c242b7a6fb27f7634_2_988x998.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"11171D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">manufacture</span><span class=\"informations\">1778×1797 231 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Sign in with EVE (optional)</strong> and it gets personal:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Uses your blueprints’ real ME/TE, your skills and your hangars<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Stock</strong> — what you can finish <em>right now</em> without buying anything<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Jobs</strong> — every industry job across all your characters and your corporation in one<br>\nlist, with local completion times, and it feeds your free slots back into Plan<br>\n<img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Reads the order books of player structures you can dock at, which no public price<br>\nsite can see</p>\n<p>Sign-in is read-only and opt-in by tier: the default login never asks for corporation<br>\nanything. What each permission reads, and how to delete it all, is on the privacy<br>\npage.</p>\n<p><strong>Why I made it:</strong> Vorton Tuning System II is worth 214m built in Jita and 126m in<br>\nAmarr — even though Amarr has the better sell price <em>and</em> half the job fee — because<br>\nthe hull costs 1.59× more there. No single number tells you where to build. I wanted<br>\nthe tool that does the whole sum.</p>\n<p>It’s new, and some of you run industry at a scale I don’t. If a number looks wrong,<br>\nI’d rather hear it than have it sit there:</p>\n<p>• Item<br>\n• Hub / system<br>\n• What seems off</p>\n<p>Every formula and assumption is written up at<br>\n<a href=\"https://slipway.karmikl.space/how-it-works\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">How Slipway costs a build — the formulas, the data, and what is assumed</a> — including what’s estimated rather than measured.</p>\n<p>Fly safe o7<br>\nKarmikl</p>\n<p><em>Not affiliated with or endorsed by CCP / Fenris Creations.</em></p>",
